<%# The one-time reveal (design spec §6.1, Task 9) -- rendered straight from
    `Admin::ApiTokensController#create`, served `no-store`; see that
    action's own comment for why nothing else ever holds the raw token.
    This is a whole document (the create form posts with
    `data-turbo="false"`, fix round 1), so its `<head>` can carry
    `turbo-cache-control: no-cache` from the very first byte: Turbo never
    snapshots this page, so leaving it (Done, or any link) and coming Back
    refetches the list instead of restoring the reveal. A frame-rendered
    reveal couldn't guarantee that -- Turbo's promoted frame visit caches
    snapshots (and fires `turbo:before-cache`) on its own schedule, which
    either kept the reveal in the cache or, with `data-turbo-temporary`,
    removed it from the live page right after it rendered.
    `admin--token-reveal` does the copying (Clipboard API, falling back to
    selecting the text) and blanks the token on `pagehide` for the
    browser's own back/forward cache. %>
<% content_for :title, "AI assistant" %>
<% content_for :head do %>
  <meta name="turbo-cache-control" content="no-cache">
<% end %>
<div data-controller="admin--token-reveal" class="flex flex-col gap-4">
  <div>
    <h1 class="text-h1 text-ink">Your new token</h1>
    <p role="status" class="mt-1 text-warn-ink">Copy it now — it's only shown once. If you lose it, revoke it and create a new one.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="rounded-cs border border-line bg-surface p-4">
    <p class="<%= setup_label_class %>">Token</p>
    <div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap items-start gap-2">
      <pre id="api-token-value" data-admin--token-reveal-target="secret"
        class="min-w-0 flex-1 overflow-x-auto rounded-cs border border-line bg-sunken p-3 font-cs-mono"><%= @raw_token %></pre>
      <%= render Admin::ButtonComponent.new(label: "Copy token", variant: :secondary, type: "button",
            data: { action: "admin--token-reveal#copy", "admin--token-reveal-source-param": "api-token-value" }) %>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-4">
      <%= render "admin/api_tokens/connection", token: @raw_token, config_id: "api-token-config",
            config_data: { "admin--token-reveal-target": "secret" } %>
      <div class="mt-2">
        <%= render Admin::ButtonComponent.new(label: "Copy configuration", variant: :secondary, type: "button",
              data: { action: "admin--token-reveal#copy", "admin--token-reveal-source-param": "api-token-config" }) %>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p data-admin--token-reveal-target="status" role="status" aria-live="polite" class="mt-2 min-h-[1.25rem] text-sm text-meta"></p>
  </div>

  <div>
    <%= link_to "Done", admin_api_tokens_path(**admin_url_options), class: setup_primary_button_class %>
  </div>
</div>
